<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait private deposits down 1.1 pct in July.</title>
<headline>Kuwait private deposits down 1.1 pct in July.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private sector deposits with banks in Kuwait fell 1.1 percent to 6.940 billion dinars at the end of July from 7.019 billion at the end of June, Central Bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The deposits stood at 6.973 billion in July 1995.</p>
<p>			  Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				  July '96	    July '95</p>
<p>Dinar deposits		5,637.0	     5,689.2</p>
<p>Foreign currency deposits 1,303.3	     1,283.7</p>
<p>($1 = 0.299)</p>
<p>-- Inal Ersan, Kuwait newsroom +965-243-1920</p>
